<h2>Questions from Portland property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do you inspect in all Portland neighborhoods?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes, across the city and the surrounding metro area, including east Multnomah County.</p></div></details><details><summary>My house is over 100 years old. Does that affect the claim?</summary><div class="a"><p>It can affect pricing, matching and code requirements. Older finishes like plaster and old-growth trim usually cost more to repair, and the estimate should reflect that.</p></div></details><details><summary>Who handles a leak in a Portland condo?</summary><div class="a"><p>It depends on the association’s bylaws and both policies. We review them before deciding which damage belongs to which policy.</p></div></details></div>
